# Naming Conventions

## Router functions

```python
read_menus
read_menu
add_menu
update_menu
delete_menu
```

## Service functions

```python
get_menus
get_menu
create_menu
update_menu
delete_menu
login
refresh_access_token
```

## CRUD functions

```python
find_menus
find_menu_by_id
find_user_by_email
create_menu_crud
update_menu_crud
soft_delete_menu_crud
```

## `get_` vs `find_`

| Layer   | Prefix  | Example           |
| ------- | ------- | ----------------- |
| Service | `get_`  | `get_menu`        |
| CRUD    | `find_` | `find_menu_by_id` |

## Schemas

```python
LoginRequest
LoginResponse
CreateMenuRequest
UpdateMenuRequest
MenuResponse
MenuDetailResponse
```

## Models

- Class names: singular (`Menu`, `Recipe`, `User`)
- Table names: plural (`__tablename__ = "menus"`)

## Enums

Class names end with `Enum`:

```python
MenuCategoryEnum
PriceTypeEnum
UserRoleEnum
```
